31495489). May sensitize cells to DNA damage-induced apoptosis (PubMed:18505924). In skeletal muscle, mediates TNF-stimulated oxidant production (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}